  <title>Resource types</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Resources</gui><gui>Resource types</gui></guiseq> keeps the
  types an entry in the <link xref="resource_calendar"/> can have. To add one,
  click <gui>New</gui>, type the <gui>Type name</gui> and click
  <gui>Save</gui>. To rename one, double click it, change the name and click
  <gui>Save</gui>.</p>

